## Next: `.gitignore`

Create `database-programs/Library Management System/.gitignore`:

```text
# SQLite database
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# Python cache
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
.pytest_cache/

# Virtual environments
venv/
env/
.env/

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.log
*.bak
*.orig

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
*.sublime-*

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
